Empty:
    []char: text
    return: int
    test:
        return: length(text) = 0

Example:
    []char: text
    int: columns
    return: @
    run:
        throws: copy(byteText\throws) copy(split\throws) copy(count\throws)
        @: fields split(byteText(text); ",")
        return: (fields; length(fields) = columns; count(fields; Empty\test))
